          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " answers, “I have trampled the nations like grapes, and no one came to help me. I trampled them in my anger, and their blood has stained all my clothing. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I decided that the time to save my people had come; it was time to punish their enemies. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.59.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Is 59.16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I was amazed when I looked and saw that there was no one to help me. But my anger made me strong, and I won the victory myself. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In my anger I trampled whole nations and shattered them. I poured out their lifeblood on the ground.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
