          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " said, “They are my people; they will not deceive me.” And so he saved them ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "from all their suffering. It was not an angel, but the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " himself who saved them. In his love and compassion he rescued them. He had always taken care of them in the past, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "but they rebelled against him and made his Holy Spirit sad. So the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " became their enemy and fought against them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
